================================================================================
                                PROJECT SCOPE
================================================================================

This license applies to all components of the LayerCake project including:

1. CORE COMPONENTS:
   - LC_core (lexer, parser, semantic analyzer, optimizer, code generator)
   - LC_asm (assembler and linker)
   - Memory management system
   - Error handling system
   - Utility libraries

2. TOOLS AND INTERFACES:
   - Command-line interface (CLI)
   - Build system and Makefiles
   - Debugging tools
   - Package manager (if developed)
   - IDE extensions and integrations

3. DOCUMENTATION AND EXAMPLES:
   - Source code documentation
   - User manuals and guides
   - API documentation
   - Example programs and tutorials
   - Best practices guides

4. SUPPORTING MATERIALS:
   - Installation scripts
   - Testing frameworks
   - Configuration files
   - Development tools

